title: "Belgian Chamber Data: parliamentary dossiers, votes, questions and speeches of the Belgian Chamber of Representatives"
abstract: >-
  Daily-updated, structured data scraped from official documents of the
  Belgian Chamber of Representatives (dekamer.be): dossiers, plenary and
  committee meetings, votes, questions and speech transcripts, in Parquet format.
